+// The scan (ortho-hook-design.md §1-§2): six gates in order, and any failure
+// means no hook. The scan always runs to the end of the module: an early exit
+// would hide a second slot holding the same value, and the ">1 hit" rule is
+// the safety core. Installs only when exactly one slot holds calcMatrix AND
+// that one passes the neighbour + fingerprint gates; a second hit of any kind
